[{"answer":"Good morning, Clare House Hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Andrew speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm the Events Manager.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning, Andrew.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Samantha.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm arranging a party for my parents' fiftieth wedding anniversary,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm ringing to ask about hiring a room some time next September.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Also my parents and several of the guests will need accommodation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I'm sure we can help you with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Will you be having a sit-down meal or a buffet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably a sit-down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/11.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you know how many people there'll be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Around eighty, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well we have two rooms that can hold that number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/14.mp3"},{"answer":"One is the Adelphi Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That can seat 85, or hold over a hundred if people are standing for a buffet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/17.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have live music, there's room for four or five musicians in the gallery overlooking the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Our guests usually appreciate the fact that the music can be loud enough for dancing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but not too loud for conversation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I really don't like it when you can't talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Now the Adelphi Room is at the back of the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are French windows leading out onto the terrace.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/24.mp3"},{"answer":"This has a beautiful display of pots of roses at that time of the year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Which direction does it face?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Southwest,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/27.mp3"},{"answer":"so that side of the hotel gets the sun in the afternoon and early evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Very nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/29.mp3"},{"answer":"From the terrace you can see the area of trees within the grounds of the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/30.mp3"},{"answer":"or you can stroll through there to the river - that's on the far side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/31.mp3"},{"answer":"so it isn't visible from the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/32.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Then another option is the Carlton Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/34.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a bit bigger - it can hold up to 110 people","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and it has the advantage of a stage, which is useful if you have any entertainment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/36.mp3"},{"answer":"or indeed a small band can fit onto it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/37.mp3"},{"answer":"And can you go outside from the room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/38.mp3"},{"answer":"No, the Carlton Room is on the first floor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but on one side the windows look out onto the lake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I think either of those rooms would be suitable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Can I tell you about some of the options we offer in addition?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Please do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/44.mp3"},{"answer":"As well as a meal, you can have an MC, a Master of Ceremonies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/45.mp3"},{"answer":"who'll be with you throughout the party.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/46.mp3"},{"answer":"What exactly is the MC's function?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose they make a speech during the meal if we need one, do they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/49.mp3"},{"answer":"All our MCs are trained as public speakers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/50.mp3"},{"answer":"so they can easily get people's attention -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/51.mp3"},{"answer":"many guests are glad to have someone who can make themselves heard above the chatter!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And they're also your support -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/53.mp3"},{"answer":"if anything goes wrong, the MC will deal with it, so you can relax.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need to ask you about food,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but something else that's important is accommodation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You obviously have rooms in the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but do you also have any other accommodation, like cabins, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are five in the grounds, all self-contained.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/60.mp3"},{"answer":"They each sleep two to four people and have their own living room, bathroom and small kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds perfect for what we'll need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Now you have various facilities, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they all included in the price of hiring the room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/64.mp3"},{"answer":"The pool, for instance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Normally you'd be able to use it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/66.mp3"},{"answer":"but it'll be closed throughout September for refurbishment, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/67.mp3"},{"answer":"The gym will be available, though, at no extra charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/68.mp3"},{"answer":"That's open all day, from six in the morning until midnight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And the tennis courts, but there is a small additional payment for those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/71.mp3"},{"answer":"We have four courts, and it's worth booking in advance if you possibly can,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/72.mp3"},{"answer":"as there can be quite a long waiting list for them!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Now could we discuss the food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/75.mp3"},{"answer":"This would be dinner, around seven o'clock...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-1-2023-02-07-10-34-26/76.mp3"}]
